set.body:
Close the remediation only from integrated evidence.

After the projection and solver APIs stabilize:
- extend multivar-ir with stable projection-action, synthesis-capability, lowering, and result descriptors where cross-language durability is required;
- synchronize modules/multivar/README.md, docs/module-relations.md, and docs/plans/multivar-operator-core.md;
- add multivarious parity fixtures, independent dense or convex oracles, algebraic laws, negative construction tests, and sparse/allocation probes;
- verify no dataset, image, scheduler, Breeze, or platform-only dependency enters multivar.

Acceptance at one committed tip:
- focused multivar and multivar-ir suites pass on JVM and Scala.js;
- inference and affected MVPA consumers pass;
- git diff --check is clean;
- a clean detached worktree passes sbt compileAll testAll;
- Mote store is clean and the architecture documentation lists supported and intentionally unsupported projection and variational operations precisely.
